flowchart LR
    S[Susceptible<br/>Population] -->|Exposure to<br/>disinformation| E[Exposed<br/>Incubating]
    E -->|σ-coherence<br/>fails| I[Infected<br/>Believing & Sharing]
    I -->|Intervention/<br/>time| R[Resistant<br/>Immunized]
    R -.->|σ decays| S
    
    S2[σ-coherence]:::sigma -.->|Protective factor| E
    R2[σ-coherence boost<br/>from interventions]:::sigma -.->|Strengthens| R
    
    I2[R₀]:::r0 -.->|Spread rate| I
    
    classDef sigma fill:#9B59B6,color:#fff
    classDef r0 fill:#E74C3C,color:#fff
